{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10010_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:89d1924816bb84e9e4ae224d590fd9d018b828e7dfc09bf90692e92fc91e983c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a390cd57673cb3bd938f1715b43facbd949a1054ceb038a14170c457334c14fd",
      "text": "我也看过，无论哪篇报道都能感受到编辑\n热忱的好杂志啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8797b8d0cefe05d9e3e6edb5fa312c72006d757ad4d130d337e0f8c79eb8fa7c",
      "text": "看中我们才找来的工作……更何况是搭档的\n爱读之书，那就更得全力以赴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a66570e1877ca7ed4c87b6152fcf2b461d93ff06ccb9548b734d34e154178dfa",
      "text": "刚才我还跟喵子说，\n要是哪天能接到摩托车的工作就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c355878b804e7ca2d9b7ca37c04ea3c640f8ea3dd6a37f707482709547d859c",
      "text": "没想到居然这么快就实现了……\n嘿嘿，简直跟做梦一样啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62b1e5e13d852f33dc522b65ad73c40195ca428a17b8e5029e806fa24251ac23",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー，\n活动舞台上要做些什么啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:043de8995e427df96dfece9050e0dc4cb23547143580663250be97a0022534b5",
      "text": "除了关于杂志和摩托车的脱口秀之外，\n还预定公开表演CM中使用的全新曲目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efb873ab64a9284c659ca3d0618b5c667fa85e4fcc3650aca0110a0916675b88",
      "text": "太好啦，包在我们身上！绝对给你们带来最棒的\n舞台。大干一场吧，玄武、喵子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aed9f963b4cb3319e7ccc905b452b12a3dd6f0bf4fa5377b9795f53a726f560",
      "text": "噢！气焰万丈，这里怎能不\n燃烧起来。大干一场吧，搭档！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:360ba9083c5956cea80a92783b8bc7c49b4b06080d9ee4b822bed4c2b6131917",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
